n of the owner of Kitamura Sports. In the same neighborhood is a batting center run by the Tsukishima family. Due to their proximity and the relationship between their businesses, the Kitamura and Tsukishima families have been close for many years, with their children going back and forth between the two homes like extended family. Because Kou and Wakaba were the same age and always together, Aoba was jealous of all the time Kou spent with her older sister. Aoba is a natural pitcher with excellent form, and Kou secretly trains to become as good as she was, even while publicly showing little interest in baseball."},"tags":[{"name":"Baseball","rank":97,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School Club","rank":97,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Coming of Age","rank":83,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Male Protagonist","rank":83,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tragedy","rank":80,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Tomboy","rank":75,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tsundere","rank":74,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":71,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Heterosexual","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Love Triangle","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Teen Cast","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Time Skip","rank":55,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Shounen","rank":49,"spoiler":false}],"titles":{"display":"Cross Game","english":"Cross Game","native":"クロスゲーム","romaji":"Cross Game","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"四叶游戏"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"幸运四叶草"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":"四叶草游戏"}]},"trailer":null,"visibility":"general"}